[31;1m## Disclaimer[0m
[31;1m[0m
[31;1mEverything here is a simulation for research. Nothing is a recommendation to buy or sell any security. Costs are illustrative, the history is short, dividends are missing from the full-universe runs and no forecaster has beaten the random control so far.[0m
